{"version":1,"key":"card:617","content":{"id":617,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"satisfies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 TypeScript 4.9 引入的一个操作符，它可以检查一个表达式是否满足给定类型，并且会保留"},{"type":"formatted","text":"最具体","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"的推断类型。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了明确 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"satisfies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的作用，我们可以看下一般情况我们是如何检查类型的，以及会存在什么问题，通常情况下我们会通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":": Type","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"as Type","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来指定类型，通过这种方式指定类型后会导致类型被放宽"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors: Record<string, Color> = {\n  primary: '#1a73e8',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n}\n\n// Property 'charAt' does not exist on type 'Color'.\n//   Property 'charAt' does not exist on type '[number, number, number]'.ts(2339)\nconsole.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));","uuid":"a8d5f734-49fb-41a1-9752-2363b584479c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors = {\n  primary: '#1a73e8',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n} as Record<string, Color>;\n\n// Property 'charAt' does not exist on type 'Color'.\n//   Property 'charAt' does not exist on type '[number, number, number]'.ts(2339)\nconsole.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));","uuid":"d098f6ab-a36c-45c2-aeed-54bf34a7dbfe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在指定类型后，所有值的类型都变为了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Color","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即使我们知道 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"colors.primary","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的类型是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是会被放宽到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Color","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的方法，必须在进一步判断对类型进行收窄以后才能当作 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","code":"if (typeof colors.primary === 'string') {\n  console.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));\n}","uuid":"cf311872-fe29-4aba-9e60-43fbf052ddae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要解决这个问题，可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"satisfies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它可以验证表达式是否满足类型，又能将表达式推断为最具体的类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors = {\n  primary: '#1a73e8',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n} satisfies Record<string, Color>;\n\nconsole.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));","uuid":"6afd28fd-dee2-4f38-b508-ba82443a01db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_655f42c7-0f96-42ef-9ada-ef97744cff1a.png","uuid":"f7bc70ff-e919-49c0-b9be-ef95b172751c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_655f42c7-0f96-42ef-9ada-ef97744cff1a.png","width":292.5000049812454},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果仅仅是将变量收缩到最具体的类型，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"as const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也可以解决"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors = {\n  primary: '#1a73e8',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n} as const;\n\nconsole.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));","uuid":"41475cf1-44d5-4f74-bb57-e26abca7463a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b1461c81-40a1-4fa7-bef9-5a8bb2fbf3f3.png","uuid":"0fb38139-79d9-414d-afdc-94ea4ee18b0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b1461c81-40a1-4fa7-bef9-5a8bb2fbf3f3.png","width":330.3571484830916},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"as const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会存在两个问题："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"as const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是把表达式收缩到字面量类型，但是不验证类型，即使表达式不符合你预期的类型也没有问题，只会在最使用的时候才会报错，相比于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"satisfies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 无法即时验证类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors = {\n  primary: 'rgb(32, 115, 232)',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n} as const;\n\nfunction testColors(colors: Record<string, Color>) {}\n\ntestColors(colors)","uuid":"2708fb3b-fb17-4af9-b1db-54085e9cfab1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_32180585-ac6d-4e83-b43b-491fe763e8ad.png","uuid":"3ffe0b28-9628-4a5e-972c-c88a63233c34","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_32180585-ac6d-4e83-b43b-491fe763e8ad.png","width":409.2857212558086}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"as const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会把所有的变量都会变为只读，无法进行修改"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_40151b21-2acd-47b5-a410-596c0e5b113e.png","uuid":"c5667aa9-56ea-4205-98e7-aa310d230ca0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_40151b21-2acd-47b5-a410-596c0e5b113e.png","width":444.64286471508}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/satisfies"],"createTime":1755849476789,"updateTime":1759033664419,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1759033664419}}